#: ../../source/docs/heliquads.rst:5 b993949280a34a63bc7141f5b5f1f732
msgid "HeliQuads (Variable Pitch Multicopters)"
msgstr "HeliQuad（可变桨距多旋翼）"

#: ../../source/docs/heliquads.rst:10 865267fa39274b558b3b3124ed832020
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports HeliQuads, also called Collective Pitch Quadcopters or "
"Variable Pitch Multicopters."
msgstr "ArduPilot 支持 HeliQuad，也称为集体桨距四旋翼或可变桨距多旋翼。"

#: ../../source/docs/heliquads.rst:14 4f9d84689ac943ab8a6ca8410aac327f
msgid ""
"Heli quad requires a :ref:`traditional helicopter <traditional-helicopters>`"
" as the base firmware. It is available for download from the `firmware "
"server <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`__. When Copter is compiled, it now"
" generates both traditional helicopter and multirotor firmware."
msgstr ""
"Heli quad 需要以 :ref:`传统直升机 <traditional-helicopters>` 为基础固件。可从 `固件服务器 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`__ 下载。Copter 编译时，现在会同时生成传统直升机和多旋翼固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/heliquads.rst:16 ece651d086b242769836661629b1972b
msgid ""
"These vehicles use independently controlled collective pitch on each of 4 "
"rotors, with a single electric motor that powers all 4 rotors at the same "
"speed via belts and a torque tube. It is highly aerobatic, capable of "
"inverted flight but can suffer from :ref:`high vibration levels <common-"
"measuring-vibration>`."
msgstr ""
"这些飞行器在 4 个旋翼的每一个上都有独立控制的总距，由一个电机通过皮带和扭矩管以相同速度驱动所有 4 "
"个旋翼。它具有高特技飞行能力，能够倒飞，但可能存在 :ref:`高震动水平 <common-measuring-vibration>` 的问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/heliquads.rst:20 0a91940d919a43a9baa9deb11f7e2a51
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/heliquads.rst:22 7be3de13e43d43d4904e3e7a817b331e
msgid ""
"WLtoys Assassin V383 is available from retailers including `WLtoys.eu "
"<https://wltoys.eu/wltoys-v383>`__"
msgstr ""
"WLtoys Assassin V383 可从零售商处购买，包括 `WLtoys.eu "
"<https://wltoys.eu/wltoys-v383>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/heliquads.rst:25 28bbbf6a16034bd19ce14dd3c70ffe3b
msgid "Connecting and Configuring"
msgstr "连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/heliquads.rst:31 1575350e77b24b2392fa68edbec3bdc8
msgid ""
"each servo should be connected using the same outputs that would be used for"
" motors on a regular multicopter (:ref:`see order here <connect-escs-and-"
"motors>`)"
msgstr "每个舵机应使用与普通多旋翼电机相同的输出连接（:ref:`顺序见此处 <connect-escs-and-motors>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/heliquads.rst:32 7a9402c656ed44ba8cd7459543d4eeeb
msgid ""
"the motor's ESC should be connected to the autopilot's channel 8 output"
msgstr "电机的 ESC 应连接到飞控的第 8 通道输出"

#: ../../source/docs/heliquads.rst:33 8e8b23a3607e4fe596db4cf7f9cfec68
msgid ""
":ref:`traditional helicopter firmware <traditional-helicopters>` should be "
"loaded onto the vehicle."
msgstr ":ref:`传统直升机固件 <traditional-helicopters>` 应加载到飞行器上。"

#: ../../source/docs/heliquads.rst:35 727226fbfe254d4ea8db25635a7ed022
msgid ""
"If using the `WLToys Assassin V383 a parameter file is available here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/WLToys_V383_HeliQuad.param>`__"
" and can be used to set all parameters immediately. For other builds these "
"are the standard params that should be set:"
msgstr ""
"如果使用 `WLToys Assassin V383，此处有可用的参数文件 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/WLToys_V383_HeliQuad.param>`__，可用于立即设置所有参数。对于其他机型，这些是应设置的标准参数："

#: ../../source/docs/heliquads.rst:38 2f184ca0c98949e09b328f81a4aa1e96
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS <FRAME_CLASS>` to 13 (HeliQuad)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS <FRAME_CLASS>` 设为 13（HeliQuad）"

#: ../../source/docs/heliquads.rst:39 3fd5af00d67340d99a9cbb0a5a88da94
msgid ""
":ref:`FRAME_TYPE <FRAME_CLASS>` to 1 (\"X\" if front right motors spins "
"counter clockwise) or 3 (\"H\" if front right motor spins clockwise)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE <FRAME_CLASS>` 设为 1（\"X\"如果右前电机逆时针旋转）或 3（\"H\"如果右前电机顺时针旋转）"

#: ../../source/docs/heliquads.rst:41 a3b1ac23a8b6427392628d45755b0c0e
msgid ""
"Similar to a :ref:`traditional helicopter <traditional-helicopters>` an "
":ref:`auxiliary switch <common-auxiliary-functions>` should be set to "
"\"Motor Interlock\" to turn on/off the motor.  Normally this is channel 8 so"
" you could set :ref:`RC8_OPTION<RC8_OPTION>` to 32."
msgstr ""
"与 :ref:`传统直升机 <traditional-helicopters>` 类似，应将 :ref:`辅助开关 <common-auxiliary-"
"functions>` 设置为\"Motor Interlock\"以开启/关闭电机。通常这是第 8 通道，因此可以将 "
":ref:`RC8_OPTION<RC8_OPTION>` 设为 32。"

